WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.917 --> 00:00:03.920
At the height of my career I had a dream

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.632
that I was holding a finch, a tiny delicate bird

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:11.511
and it was my pet and I put it back into its cage.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:14.055
I had been auditioning like crazy,

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:16.391
I had been pounding the pavement,

00:00:16.391 --> 00:00:19.602
and there was a breaking point where I was just like, I'm tired, I'm tired,

00:00:19.602 --> 00:00:22.397
I don't know if I'm going to do this anymore, noone's seeing me.

00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:24.357
"Oh he's too this, or he's too that,

00:00:24.357 --> 00:00:26.776
or he's too flamboyant, or he's too ..."

00:00:26.776 --> 00:00:29.571
You know I heard flamboyant so many times.

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:30.530
I wasn't sort of either thing that society said that I should be

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.659
and so I always felt a little out of place.

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:38.580
I thought, well, there's no place for someone like me. I'm too weird!

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:40.040
I'm probably too gay!

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.834
I just could not get a show made. I couldn't get a show made.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:46.046
And I didn't want to write it, I didn't think it was that fascinating,

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.380
didn't think it was that entertaining,

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:51.885
I was just thinking, it's just, I can't, how much longer can I do this

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:54.012
without having a breakthrough.

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:57.640
Literally the next day, I get a telephone call.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.310
And my agent sends me this script.

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:05.815
And the character breakdown for the character of Taylor Mason said nonbinary.

00:01:05.815 --> 00:01:10.278
Hello. I'm Taylor. My pronouns are they, theirs, and them.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:10.695
Okay.

